<title>USA: AlliedSignal completes Prestone acquisition.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal completes Prestone acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS TOWNSHIP, N.J. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlliedSignal Inc said on Tuesday it has completed its acquisition of Prestone Products Corp, a privately owned supplier of car care products, from Vestar Capital Partners.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Headquartered in Danbury, Connecticut, Prestone Products Corporation employs approximately 270 people at manufacturing plants in California, Illinois and New Jersey, and a research and development facility in Danbury.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
